# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FAST Shooter .gitignore
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. CMake Build Directory
# Never commit the build folder. It contains machine-specific binaries 
# and copied assets that will waste massive amounts of space on GitHub.
build/

# 2. Compiled Object Files
# These are intermediate garbage files generated during compilation.
*.o

# 3. Old Binaries
# This is your old, pre-CMake executable. We don't track compiled programs.
game_build

# 4. Dynamic Game Data
# If you commit this, every time you or someone else plays the game and 
# gets a new high score, Git will flag the repository as "modified". 
High Score.txt

# 5. OS and Editor Junk (Standard Practice)
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
